    "That placement cannot be solved on this frame." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この写真ではその配置を計算できません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这张照片上解不出这样的安置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這張照片上解不出這樣的安置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ sheet alone, flat, with its scale and every film at its size. Size is the sheet's short edge; it prints at %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@の台紙、フィルムは実寸。%2$@で印刷できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 版面，底片按实际尺寸，可按 %@ 打印。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 版面，底片按實際尺寸，可按 %@ 列印。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Latitude card shades what was pulled." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "寛容度のカードに、引き込んだ部分が色付きで示されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "宽容度卡片会标出收进来的部分。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "寬容度卡片會標出收進來的部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The RAW file's own lens correction: distortion and vignetting." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "RAWファイル自体のレンズ補正：歪曲と周辺減光。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "RAW 文件自带的镜头校正：畸变与暗角。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "RAW 檔自帶的鏡頭校正：變形與暗角。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The RAW file's white balance, before the film." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "フィルムの前に適用する、RAWファイルのホワイトバランス。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "RAW 文件的白平衡，在上胶片之前。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "RAW 檔的白平衡，在上底片之前。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The SpektraLab Library Becomes a Catalog" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SpektraLab ライブラリがカタログになります"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SpektraLab 图库将成为一个目录"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SpektraLab 圖庫將成為一個目錄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The SpektraLab engine is a C++/Metal implementation derived from spektrafilm by Andrea Volpato (GPL-3.0-or-later)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SpektraLabエンジンは、Andrea Volpatoによるspektrafilmから派生したC++/Metalによる実装です（GPL-3.0-or-later）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SpektraLab 引擎是由 Andrea Volpato 的 spektrafilm 衍生而来的 C++/Metal 实现（GPL-3.0-or-later）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SpektraLab 引擎是由 Andrea Volpato 的 spektrafilm 衍生而來的 C++/Metal 實作（GPL-3.0-or-later）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app's memory as it runs: how much it held and how much the Mac had left, at each page, and whenever it rose or fell." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Appの動作中のメモリ：使用量とMacの残りを、各画面で、また増減したときに記録します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App 运行时的内存：它占用了多少、Mac 还剩多少，记录于每个页面，以及内存升降的时候。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App 執行時的記憶體：它佔用了多少、Mac 還剩多少，記錄於每個頁面，以及記憶體升降的時候。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The black-and-white films and their paper are SpektraLab's own profiles, built from their makers' published data sheets, under CC BY-SA 4.0 as well." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "白黒フィルムとその印画紙は、各製造元が公開している技術資料をもとに作成したSpektraLab独自の特性データで、同じくCC BY-SA 4.0で提供しています。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "黑白胶片及其相纸是 SpektraLab 自制的特性文件，依据厂商公开的技术资料制作，同样以 CC BY-SA 4.0 许可。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "黑白底片及其相紙是 SpektraLab 自製的描述檔，依據廠商公開的技術資料製作，同樣以 CC BY-SA 4.0 授權。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The body sets the gate, the margins and where the holes fall." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本体によって、画枠、余白、送り穴の位置が決まります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "机身决定片门、边距和齿孔的位置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "機身決定片門、邊距和齒孔的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The border is added outside the picture: it takes none of its pixels." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "縁は画像の外側に付き、画像のピクセルを使いません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "边框加在画面之外：不占画面的像素。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "邊框加在畫面之外：不佔畫面的像素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera every new film edge is shot through: its gate, its fog, its leaks. A frame keeps the body it was given." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新しいフィルムエッジにのみ適用されます。既存の写真は変更されません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅用于新片边，已有照片不变。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "僅用於新片邊，現有照片不變。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera's own preview" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "カメラのプレビュー"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "相机自带的预览"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "相機自帶的預覽"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera’s corner. Turned, it turns too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "カメラ側の角です。回転すると、これも回転します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "相机上的那个角。胶片转了，它也跟着转。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "相機上的那個角。底片轉了，它也跟著轉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The colour film and paper profiles are from spektrafilm by Andrea Volpato, under CC BY-SA 4.0." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
